usiness_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"M176-LxXhDS2RZzYGzAa1g","review_id":"GZ84hNygo1KsjxlBe2ndWg","date":"2016-11-23T01:07:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9308134317398071,"text_excerpt":"These are delicious tamales! The gentleman who owns the truck is extremely nice as well. Sometimes he has cracklin and they are some of the best in the city!!"},{"business_id":"M176-LxXhDS2RZzYGzAa1g","review_id":"l9RIrWum69K4G8tryEhl0g","date":"2017-07-22T04:17:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9184368848800659,"text_excerpt":"I was sitting outside of Mick's when all of a sudden, a little green truck zoomed up! It was M & M Tamales! A guy popped out and announced to the bar crowd the tamale specials. I quickly raised my hand and ordered! He brought the tamales out to me. The tamales were smaller but an order of a half dozen left me oh so satisfied. There was a delicious onion and tomato sauce poured on top that I could drink by itself. Before I knew it, the little green truck zoomed away in no time. Excellent food truck nibbles!"},{"business_id":"M176-LxXhDS2RZzYGzAa1g","review_id":"xcl6inTRvR-NYA85-Au_fQ","date":"2018-02-06T21:47:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9097670316696167,"text_excerpt":"Tried these today and they were some of the best tamales I've had in the city. They are easily in my top 3 favorites, and I've tried tamales from many locations. They were seasoned to perfection with some spiciness. The owner serves them piping hot, and he's not skimpy with the meat filling. The onions are optional!!!! The owner is also a sweetheart. Very personable and I could tell that he loves his work!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
